e shrink factor follows the grow factor and defaults to 1 */.t71{flex:0 auto}/*! flex: ...over any basis a factor cannot be read as */.t71b{flex:2 50%}/*! declined: CSS Flexbox 1 §7.1.1 reads a unitless zero not preceded by two factors as a factor */.t71c{flex:3 1 0}/*! initial: a slot every value of which is a keyword or a call is checked for a sibling like a keywords-only one */.t72{background:#fff}/*! initial: ...and the same slot's other initials go with it */.t72b{background:red}/*! declined: an image function fills the same slot, so the value is one the engine drops */.t72c{background:none url(http://website.test/cat.jpg)}/*! the origin and the clip are two slots of one production, so neither initial
