"/*! convert-values: should convert milliseconds to seconds */.t01{transition-duration:.5s}/*! convert-values: should convert milliseconds to seconds (2) */.t02{animation:opacity 0s 1s}/*! convert-values: should convert seconds to milliseconds */.t03{transition-duration:5ms}/*! convert-values: should convert values in custom properties */.t04{--my-variable:500ms}/*! convert-values: should strip the leading plus */.t05{width:14px}/*! declined: px -> pc/pt/in is exact, but it fires ~10 times in all of Bootstrap
